Package: cinminai-guide-model
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cin-MinAI <https://github.com/Cin-MinAI/Cin-MinAI>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: coreutils, curl
Description: The Cin-MinAI guide model (fetched and checked)
 The small model built into Cin-MinAI (cycle 0: Qwen3.5-4B, fine-tuned, Q4_K_M,
 2.8 GB, Apache-2.0). The file is too big for a package: this one copies it from
 the Cin-MinAI USB stick or DVD when present, or downloads it, and checks its
 SHA-256 before use. Model card: https://huggingface.co/CinMin/guide-4b
 (training/guide/MODEL_CARD.md).
